        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Side mirror Used to see vehicles behind and to your side for safety."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "[Figure/Diagram]"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Windscreen Wipers Switch Used to turn your windscreen wipers on, off or to a higher or lower wiper setting for a clear view while driving in rain. Also used to try to clean your windscreen"
